    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dreamstate is a point-and-click, sit-and-survival, and psychological horror game. You play as Jack, a once married man who sadly lost the love of his life. As Jack, you play through multiple nights where you experience his sleep paralysis. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story mode: Play all the nights and fight off Jack's sleep paralysis and uncover secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overdose mode: A night with every enemy attacking Jack at once with the highest difficulty possible. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paralysis mode: A game mode with a high difficulty but an endless timer. Try to survive the longest than others and compete for a higher time.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dreamstate is a point-and-click, sit-and-survival, and psychological horror game. You play as Jack, a once married man who sadly lost the love of his life. As Jack, you play through multiple nights where you experience his sleep paralysis. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story mode: Play all the nights and fight off Jack's sleep paralysis and uncover secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overdose mode: A night with every enemy attacking Jack at once with the highest difficulty possible. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paralysis mode: A game mode with a high difficulty but an endless timer. Try to survive the longest than others and compete for a higher time.</p>",
